description=Orchestrator for a bring-your-own STRONG stack: drives your own PlayIntegrityFork + JingMatrix TEESimulator (+ HMA-OSS). Bundles no modules. Mirrors the PIF fingerprint into TEESimulator, builds its target list, syncs the security patch, writes the root-of-trust overrides and fetches your keybox.
